Package: sta310
Title: Data Sets and Teaching Functions for the STA310 Survival Analysis Course
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Erik", "Bülow", , "eriklgb@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The data sets that accompany Collett (2023), "Modelling Survival
    Data in Medical Research" (4th edition), documented for the STA310 course at
    the University of Gothenburg. The package also provides a small set of
    teaching functions that implement the estimators used in the lectures from
    first principles: the Kaplan-Meier estimator, Cox regression by
    Newton-Raphson, empirical hazards, log-rank power and sample size, and
    cumulative incidence functions from cause-specific hazards.
